Subject: [PATCH] refactor(application): extract TablePager from TableQueryViewModel

Move the paging position of the table screen (current cursor, history
stack, last result, has-next) into TablePager, a pure class in
Application/Search. The view model keeps fetching, busy/error state and
every binding, so TableQueryView.xaml is unchanged. PageCursor becomes
a public record next to the pager. Adds 9 TablePagerTests.

Static review only: not compiled, not run (no .NET in the AI sandbox).

